  "description": "Due to a bitter rivalry, professional baseball players Jo Jin and Hyang-Gi view each other as enemies. Both planning quiet retirements from their respective teams, they suddenly exchange punches during a game, engaging in a brawl that goes down in pro baseball history and gets them released from their teams. Now, they've set their sights on returning to the professional ranks—a comeback everyone says is impossible. They've resolved to run the bases once more. To become useful people, simply to retire as ordinary players.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
